  "source_hash": 11553734167958560707,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Finding area of simple polygon in O(N)",
      "source_hash": 17856555915062906500,
      "context_hash": 10356351620332465896,
      "translation": "O(N)에 단순 다각형의 넓이 구하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Finding area of simple polygon in $O(N)$",
      "source_hash": 5401904223583991382,
      "context_hash": 457958553953639105,
      "translation": "$O(N)$에 단순 다각형의 넓이 구하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Let a simple polygon (i.e. without self intersection, not necessarily convex) be given.",
      "source_hash": 12877802299545471800,
      "context_hash": 3348275263801720736,
      "translation": "단순 다각형(즉, 자기 교차가 없으며 반드시 볼록일 필요는 없는 다각형)이 주어졌다고 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is required to calculate its area given its vertices.",
      "source_hash": 11102882219276716107,
      "context_hash": 12913281792315901268,
      "translation": "정점들이 주어졌을 때 그 넓이를 계산해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Method 1",
      "source_hash": 5017855263863871300,
      "context_hash": 4506769595573090399,
      "translation": "방법 1",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This is easy to do if we go through all edges and add trapezoid areas bounded by each edge and x-axis.",
      "source_hash": 4265770527364587929,
      "context_hash": 15343807185734678196,
      "translation": "모든 간선을 순회하면서 각 간선과 x축으로 둘러싸인 사다리꼴의 넓이를 더하면 쉽게 구할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "edge": "간선"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The area needs to be taken with sign so that the extra area will be reduced.",
      "source_hash": 1734180323926985843,
      "context_hash": 17094121007696054300,
      "translation": "여분의 넓이가 상쇄되도록 넓이에 부호를 붙여서 더해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Hence, the formula is as follows:",
      "source_hash": 9962277309819680271,
      "context_hash": 9679199097604296165,
      "translation": "따라서 공식은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Code:",
      "source_hash": 5289826325646780921,
      "context_hash": 9673588296393638192,
      "translation": "코드:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Method 2",
      "source_hash": 12939121639489702008,
      "context_hash": 12212729407299012348,
      "translation": "방법 2",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036630Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We can choose a point $O$ arbitrarily, iterate over all edges adding the oriented area of the triangle formed by the edge and point $O$.",
      "source_hash": 8966977297803862809,
      "context_hash": 814408218430202372,
      "translation": "점 $O$를 임의로 선택한 뒤, 모든 간선을 순회하면서 각 간선과 점 $O$로 이루어진 삼각형의 방향 있는 넓이를 더할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "edge": "간선"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036630Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Again, due to the sign of area, extra area will be reduced.",
      "source_hash": 12969749871509788868,
      "context_hash": 4692024448995982597,
      "translation": "이번에도 넓이의 부호 덕분에 여분의 넓이가 상쇄됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036630Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This method is better as it can be generalized to more complex cases (such as when some sides are arcs instead of straight lines)",
      "source_hash": 7353158283218517335,
      "context_hash": 2758844722825730282,
      "translation": "이 방법은 더 복잡한 경우(예를 들어 일부 변이 직선이 아니라 호인 경우)로 일반화할 수 있으므로 더 좋습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:17:48.036630Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}